<title>USA: CCC seeks edible oil for Mozambique, Peru.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks edible oil for Mozambique, Peru.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said Monday it was seeking 3,970 tonnes of sunflowerseed oil for donation to Mozambique and 7,200 tonnes of soybean oil for Peru.</p>
<p>All of the oil is slated for shipment during October 1-20.</p>
<p>Offers are due on August 25 for reply the following day, said the CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
